exists su name boundary classifier be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext text "You read the first gross chip (user content). Identify the document kind and explain how to detect section boundaries in this document type. Your output is a prompt that will be given to small LLMs to find section boundaries in each chip and return a single exact boundary marker quote. The prompt must instruct the model to avoid seam duplicates: do not return a marker that is identical to the immediately previous chip marker when possible, and prefer the first new heading after the first 80 characters of the chip when available. Output exactly two paragraphs: (1) Document kind and cues. (2) Boundary detection guidance with examples anchored to the chip text and a final sentence stating the required output format (single boundary marker quote only). Use short, concrete sentences. No bullet lists." ya

su name boundary refinery be refinery def
su name load source from filename "documentation/specifications/01-sentence-and-grammar.md" become wo text to name text source be read do
su name gross chip from name text source atmost byte 2400 to name text gross chips be gross chip do
su name show chip ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of gross chips be write do
su name classify prompt ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of gross chips for name boundary classifier to name text boundary prompt be write do
su name show prompt ob text of ob of boundary prompt be write do
exists su name boundary swallower be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext name boundary prompt ya
su name boundary proposal map from name gross chips by name boundary swallower to name text boundary proposals be series map do
su name show proposal ob text of ob of 0 of series of ob of boundary proposals be write do
su name resolve wise from name text source by name text boundary proposals atleast byte 800 atmost byte 2600 to name text wise chips be wise chip do
prah

from name boundary refinery be refinery do
